### ✅ **Binary Search – Iterative Method**
```c
int binarySearchIter(int arr[], int n, int key) {
    int low = 0, high = n - 1;

    while (low <= high) {
        int mid = (low + high) / 2;

        if (arr[mid] == key)
            return mid;
        else if (arr[mid] < key)
            low = mid + 1;
        else
            high = mid - 1;
    }
    return -1; // Not found
}
```

---

### ✅ **Binary Search – Recursive Method**
```c
int binarySearchRec(int arr[], int low, int high, int key) {
    if (low > high)
        return -1;  // Not found

    int mid = (low + high) / 2;

    if (arr[mid] == key)
        return mid;
    else if (arr[mid] < key)
        return binarySearchRec(arr, mid + 1, high, key);
    else
        return binarySearchRec(arr, low, mid - 1, key);
}
```

---

### ⏱️ **Time Complexity**
| Case | Complexity |
|------|------------|
| Best | **O(1)** (key at middle) |
| Worst | **O(log n)** |
| Average | **O(log n)** |

